WEBVTT

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.693
By experimenting with new strains of rice,

00:04:32.717 --> 00:04:34.066
irrigating less

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:38.056
and adopting less labor-intensive
ways of planting seeds,

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.487
farmers in these countries

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:43.236
have already increased
their incomes and crop yields

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.790
while cutting down
on greenhouse gas emissions.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.451
In Zambia,

00:04:48.475 --> 00:04:52.689
numerous organizations
are investing in locally specific methods

00:04:52.713 --> 00:04:56.134
to improve crop production,
reduce forest loss

00:04:56.158 --> 00:04:59.541
and improve livelihoods for local farmers.

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:02.236
These efforts are projected
to increase crop yield